# Clone sources (design faster)

Do not invent chat chrome, thread lists, composers, thinking states, tool cards, or approval cards. Open the source, copy the interaction, restyle to our tokens. Port Opal — do not install `@onyx-ai/opal`. Primitives land in `packages/opath-ui`.

| Surface | Copy from | Open |
|---|---|---|
| Public landing `/` | [onyx.app](https://onyx.app/) | Sticky nav, hero composer, waitlist bar, how-it-works |
| Primitives (chip, tooltip, collapsible, tabs, table, code) | [Onyx Opal](https://onyx-storybook.vercel.app/) | Matching story |
| Approval, input bar interrupt/queue | Opal Craft stories | Approvals / Input Bar |
| Reasoning panel | [assistant-ui reasoning panel](https://www.assistant-ui.com/elements/reasoning-panel) | Shimmering Thinking, elapsed, collapsible steps |
| Tool call | [assistant-ui tool call](https://www.assistant-ui.com/elements/tool-call) | Shimmering verb, query chip, Request / Result |
| Rail, prompt bar polish | [Beautiful UI](https://www.beautifului.dev/) | Sidebar Nav, Prompt Bar, Chat |
| Thread, thread list, composer, empty welcome, retry, stop | [assistant-ui](https://www.assistant-ui.com/docs/ui/thread) | Thread + [ThreadList](https://www.assistant-ui.com/docs/ui/thread-list) |
| History grouping, message action bar, queued messages | Open WebUI (patterns only) | Do not copy source |

**Do not install** `@onyx-ai/opal`, `@assistant-ui/react`, or paste Beautiful UI’s demo tokens. Do not copy Open WebUI code. Keep `conversation.*`, the command bus, and `docs/copy.md`.

**Skip:** command palette, unread badges, `/` search, model picker, dictation — [navigation.md](docs/features/navigation.md) out of scope.

If a surface takes props, it gets a story. Screens that fetch stay in the app.

Map and house rules: [docs/design-system/clone-sources.md](docs/design-system/clone-sources.md).
